    ; --- the MATH family ---------------------------------------------------------
    ; SgmlFOTBuilder implements every one of the twelve. ★A PORT element opens
    ; with startPortFlow (`<name>` + RE, NO inherited characteristics) while the
    ; class's own element opens with startSimpleFlowObj (ics flushed into the
    ; tag) — the ics belong to the flow object, not to its ports.
    ; ★And the four classes with a principal port (script, mark, fence,
    ; math-operator) plus radical open `<x.principal>` as part of the SERIAL
    ; open and close it in their FIRST port bracket, so the principal content is
    ; wrapped without any callback of its own. `fraction` has no principal port
    ; and so no such element.
    procedure start_port_flow(mutable this: ref[SgmlFOTBuilder], name: Slice[char]) linked







