    ; --- the PAGE/COLUMN MODEL ------------------------------------------------
    ; SgmlFOTBuilder::startPageSequenceSerial (2113) and
    ; startColumnSetSequenceSerial (1973). Both opens are SELF-CLOSING and are
    ; then closed by a real `</…>`, the asymmetry this backend has for every
    ; class it decomposes. `page-sequence` prints NOTHING but its ics — its six
    ; characteristics are inherited ones, so they arrive through outputIcs.
    procedure start_page_sequence(mutable this: ref[SgmlFOTBuilder]) linked







